<title>SOUTH KOREA: Hyundai Elec says makes fastest 1GB DRAM.</title>
<headline>Hyundai Elec says makes fastest 1GB DRAM.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korean chip maker Hyundai Electronics Industries Co said on Monday it had developed the world's &quot;fastest&quot; one gigabit synchronous dynamic random access memory (DRAM) chip using &quot;silicon-on-insulator&quot; wafers.</p>
<p>The new chip is at least 20 percent faster than any other one gigabit chips and is operable at between 1.8 and 2.2 volts, a Hyundai statement said.</p>
